{"version":1,"key":"card:609","content":{"id":609,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 TypeScript 枚举中有一种常量枚举，与一般枚举声明不同在于使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"const","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来进行修饰"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const enum Value {\n  A = 1,\n  B = 2,\n  C = \"Hello\"\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"a09a66f2-2dac-421c-95e9-9714ded29075","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么在使用上与普通枚举不同之处在哪里呢？为了回答这个问题，我们看下它们编译后的产物有何不同。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先看一下普通枚举"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"enum Value {\n  A = 1,\n  B = 2,\n  C = \"Hello\"\n}\nconsole.log(Value.A);","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"056e888f-ce80-400e-b302-036bbdcadb92","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"var Value;\n(function (Value) {\n    Value[Value[\"A\"] = 1] = \"A\";\n    Value[Value[\"B\"] = 2] = \"B\";\n    Value[\"C\"] = \"Hello\";\n})(Value || (Value = {}));\nconsole.log(Value.A);","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"c537fc38-aae7-4b52-885e-6e67e91909a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"普通枚举编译后的产物有两个特点："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"枚举被编译为了对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果枚举的值是数字，那么可以进行双向访问，即不仅可以通过键访问到值，还可以通过值访问到键"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"Value.A = 1\nValue[1] = \"A\"","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"a46e3bfd-a876-44e8-9195-144a1d548107","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接下来看下常量枚举会编译成了什么"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"const enum Value {\n  A = 1,\n  B = 2,\n  C = \"Hello\"\n}","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"4e3d9a22-c474-45a8-b2dd-6ddabfb2abf1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"console.log(1 /* Value.A */);","language":"TypeScript","uuid":"361996cb-49f0-42b3-be4c-48e9a9653cfe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到，编译后的产物根本没有枚举这个东西在，所有用到枚举的地方都被直接编译为了枚举对应的常量值。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据以上观察，可以得出有一下几点不同："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"访问性，因为常量枚举没有被编译为对象，因此也不存在双向访问的可能，即无法通过值去访问到枚举的键"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"计算值，在普通枚举中，枚举值可以不在编译期确定，可以动态计算得出，但是在常量枚举中，因为需要在编译期就要确定枚举值，这样才能在使用的地方替换为具体的值，因此在常量枚举中无法使用动态值"}]}]}]}],"tags":["TypeScript/常量枚举","概念对比"],"createTime":1753695456937,"updateTime":1753696482725,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753696482725}}